Z||000029||Racer 1||12-18-1999||04:21 AM||||"Sittin FAT"= Nice car probably better then your own.<P>"High Siding"= I forgot but remeber the name.<P>"Muffler Dragger"= muffler hanging down with coat hanger holding it from certain death.<P>"Hit the deck"= low rider sparking on the ground.<P>"nig%er rigged"= something put together quickly and might blow a fuse or start a fire.<P>"Fronting"= Dodge NEON or riceburner with racing stripes , dorky wing and a fat 6" muffler tip. Might have side stickers also.<P>"I smell bacon"= Radar detector going wild but you cant see the  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">PIG <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">.||||reg||6
